      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "The base rate and reference class are recent national monthly WIC totals clustered around 6.8-6.9 million, with May rising from 6.696739 million in 2023 to 6.763710 million in 2024 and 6.894610 million in 2025. The model prior considered was a simple seasonal-persistence/time-series prior anchored to the May observations and FY 2025 average; no fitted trend model was used because the available official sample is sparse and contains administrative volatility."
